    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Vojin, slijepi snimatelj dokumentarnih radiodrama, poziva protagoniste svojih radova da mu se pridru\u017ee u hotelu na osami. Sezona je pro\u0161la i mjesto je gotovo sasvim prazno. Tijekom intimnih razgovora Vojin i njegovi gosti upu\u0161taju se u arheolo\u0161ko putovanje ru\u0161evinama svojih traumati\u010dnih djetinjstava.",
        "english": "Vojin, a blind author of radio docudramas, invites the protagonists of his shows to meet him in an isolated hotel. It is off-season and the place is almost entirely deserted. The director and his guests dive into intimate conversations."
